---
description: EAS build, OTA updates, and local iOS AdHoc IPA signing
globs: app.json,eas.json,ios/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# EAS Build & OTA

```bash
npx eas build --profile development -p ios    # Dev client (simulator)
npx eas build --profile preview               # Internal distribution
npx eas build --profile production            # Production (autoIncrement)
npx eas update --branch preview --message "..."
npx eas update --branch production --message "..."
```

`runtimeVersion` policy = `appVersion`. Changing `app.json` version breaks OTA to older builds. Native changes (expo-* upgrades, bundle ID, scheme) require full rebuild.

# Local iOS Build & IPA (AdHoc)

```bash
npx expo prebuild --platform ios --clean

cd ios
xcodebuild -workspace SakrylleAdmin.xcworkspace \
  -scheme SakrylleAdmin -configuration Release \
  -destination 'generic/platform=iOS' \
  -derivedDataPath build -archivePath build/SakrylleAdmin.xcarchive \
  archive \
  DEVELOPMENT_TEAM=DZ6C9K6CHB \
  CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY="iPhone Distribution: Milton Kelly (DZ6C9K6CHB)" \
  CODE_SIGN_STYLE=Manual \
  "PROVISIONING_PROFILE=ad3d147c-8fce-44a8-83ce-1f2a247490f3"

xcodebuild -exportArchive \
  -archivePath build/SakrylleAdmin.xcarchive \
  -exportPath build/ipa \
  -exportOptionsPlist ExportOptions.plist
# Output: ios/build/ipa/SakrylleAdmin.ipa
```

**Signing:** `iPhone Distribution: Milton Kelly (DZ6C9K6CHB)`
**Profile UUID:** `ad3d147c-8fce-44a8-83ce-1f2a247490f3` (AdHoc, bundle `app.libra6393.papaya2609`)
**ExportOptions.plist:** `ios/ExportOptions.plist` (ad-hoc, manual signing)

Unsigned debug builds: pass `CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO` instead of signing flags.
